# The counterexample of LLM.Tok.bpe_not_shortest, with letters.
@bpe not the shortest tokenization
merge b c
merge a b
merge ab c
encode abc
count abc

@bpe leftmost occurrence wins ties
merge a a
encode aaa
encode aaaa

# tiktoken and Hugging Face with ignore_merges emit a word that is itself a token.
@bpe whole-word lookup
merge b c
merge a b
merge c d
merge ab cd
encode abcd
